<title>USA: IHOP Corp Dec same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>IHOP Corp Dec same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, Calif. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>IHOP Corp said Friday its same-store sales for the fiscal month of December were up 1.8 percent, compared to a decrease of 0.6 percent in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
</text>
